It links JavaScriptCore (WebKit, LGPL-2.0+/BSD). Standard macOS archives load
the operating-system framework. The macOS ARM64 fork archive and the Linux
archives contain a separately built, patched JavaScriptCore, linked statically
into the browser; relinking against a modified JavaScriptCore is a build of
this project's source (scripts/jsc/build.sh, PYRO_JSC_DIR).
Those variants include upstream license files and identify the matching
JavaScriptCore source archive supplied with the same release. The source
archive retains upstream notices and includes the exact WebKit revision,
Pyro patches and build instructions.

crates/pyro-dom/src/stylo/ua.css is the HTML user-agent stylesheet of
blitz-dom (https://github.com/DioxusLabs/blitz), derived from Mozilla
Firefox's html.css, under the Mozilla Public License 2.0 (header kept),
with Chrome's defaults for links and form controls.
crates/pyro-dom/src/stylo/hints.rs adapts blitz-dom's presentational hints
(MIT OR Apache-2.0). Style computation uses Stylo (MPL-2.0).

